  "status_text": "A second family now shows the same thing: as the graphs grow, the cost without NOT gates keeps climbing while the cost with them stays at most 7. For every n from 4 it needs at least 2n and at most 2n + 1 AND/OR gates of fan-in two on one-a-side inputs [L-meta-19401, L-meta-19402], and at most 7 with NOT gates [L-meta-19382]: a saving of at least 2n - 7, all checked from outside within the hour. Whether the saving stays within the 2n - 5 our bet names [L-meta-19158] these rows do not yet decide.",
